From: Biju Das <biju.das.jz@bp.renesas.com>

RZ/G2L and later SoCs need a hardware adjustment delay written to
SCC_TMPPORT2 on signal-voltage switch during tuning: 0x1 for 1.8V,
0x0 for 3.3V.

